    "无法识别客户端，请在链接末尾指定 target=clash、surge、loon、quanx、shadowrocket、hiddify 或 egern": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "عميل غير معروف، يرجى تحديد target=clash أو Surge أو loon أو quanx أو Shadowrocket أو hiddify أو egern في نهاية الرابط"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unbekannter Client, bitte geben Sie am Ende des Links target=clash, Surge, loon, quanx,shadowrocket, hiddify oder egern an"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unrecognized client, please specify target=clash, surge, loon, quanx, shadowrocket, hiddify or egern at the end of the link"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cliente no reconocido, especifique target=clash, surge, loon, quanx, shadowrocket, hiddify o egern al final del enlace."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Client non reconnu, veuillez spécifier target=clash, surge, loon, quanx, shadowrocket, hiddify ou egern à la fin du lien"
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Klien tidak dikenal, harap tentukan target=clash, surge, loon, quanx, shadowrocket, hiddify atau egern di akhir tautan"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "認識されないクライアント。リンクの最後に target=clash、surge、loon、quanx、shadowrocket、hiddify、または egern を指定してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "인식할 수 없는 클라이언트입니다. 링크 끝에 target=clash,urge, loon, quanx, Shadowrocket, hiddify 또는 egern을 지정하십시오."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cliente não reconhecido, especifique target=clash, surge, loon, quanx, shadowrocket, hiddify ou egern no final do link"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Неопознанный клиент, в конце ссылки укажите target=clash, Surge, Loon, Quanx, ShadowRocket, Hiddify или egern."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ลูกค้าที่ไม่รู้จัก โปรดระบุ target=clash, ไฟกระชาก, loon, quanx, shadowrocket, hiddify หรือ egern ที่ส่วนท้ายของลิงก์"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tanınmayan istemci, lütfen bağlantının sonunda target=clash,urge, loon, quanx, shadowrocket, hiddify veya egern belirtin"
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Khách hàng không được nhận dạng, vui lòng chỉ định target=clash, boost, loon, quanx, Shadowrocket, hiddify hoặc egern ở cuối liên kết"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法识别客户端，请在链接末尾指定 target=clash、surge、loon、quanx、shadowrocket、hiddify 或 egern"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法辨識客戶端，請在連結末端指定 target=clash、surge、loon、quanx、shadowrocket、hiddify 或 egern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
